          "zh": "Google DeepMind 推出全新富有表现力的人工智能语音模型"
        },
        "tl_dr": {
          "en": "Google DeepMind has launched Gemini 3.1 Flash TTS, a new audio model featuring granular audio tags for precise control over expressive AI speech generation.",
          "zh": "Google DeepMind 发布了 Gemini 3.1 Flash TTS，这是一个全新的音频模型，引入了精细音频标签，可精确控制富有表现力的人工智能语音生成。"
        },
        "key_takeaways": {
