            "The new audio model is designated Gemini 3.1 Flash TTS.",
            "It incorporates granular audio tags for directing AI speech.",
            "These tags provide precise control over expressive audio generation."
          ],
          "zh": [
            "新音频模型命名为 Gemini 3.1 Flash TTS。",
            "它引入了用于指导人工智能语音的精细音频标签。",
            "这些标签提供对富有表现力音频生成的精确控制。"
          ]
        },
        "impact": {
          "en": "This development advances the capability of AI systems to generate nuanced and controllable speech. It is relevant for applications requiring specific vocal expressions or delivery styles, potentially improving human-computer interaction and content creation.",
          "zh": "这一进展提升了人工智能系统生成细致且可控语音的能力。它对需要特定语音表达或传递风格的应用具有重要意义，可能改善人机交互和内容创作。"
        },
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "link": "https://deepmind.google/blog/gemini-3-1-flash-tts-the-next-generation-of-expressive-ai-speech/"
